span="1">8/10/M</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">8 mo./3</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">R: 6/6<break/> L: 6/6<sup>-2</sup></td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">None </td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">LXT 2/LXT 4</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">ARC</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Fusion/Fusion</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">RonDot=0<break/> Fly positive</td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">9/9/M</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">18 mo./6</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">R: 6/6<sup>-2</sup><break/> L: 6/7.5<sup>-2</sup></td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">None</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">LXT 10/10 LXT</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">LE supp</td><td align="center" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">LE supp/LE supp</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">RanDot=0<break/> Fly=0</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="T1FN1"><p>ARC- abnormal retinal correspondence, Supp- suppression, RE-right eye, LE- Left eye, RET/LET &#x02013; right/left esotropia, RXT/LXT- right/left exotropia. RandDot &#x02013; Random Dot E stereoacuity test, Fly &#x02013; Titmus fly test.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>